msgid ""
"This effect/filter displays a histogram of R, G and B components of the "
"video data."
msgstr "Tento efekt/filter zobrazuje histogram R, G a B zložiek video dát."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/rgb_parade.rst:51
msgid ""
"This is different from the :ref:`view-rgb_parade` from the :ref:`view_menu` "
"because the *Effect* version writes the histogram into the output video "
"whereas the *View Menu* version just displays the histogram widget in the "
"application while you preview your project."
msgstr ""
"Toto sa líši od :ref:`view-rgb_parade` z :ref:`view_menu`, pretože verzia "
"*Efekt* zapisuje histogram do výstupného videa, zatiaľ čo verzia *Ponuka "
"zobrazenia* zobrazuje iba widget histogramu v aplikácii počas náhľadu "
"projektu."
